Few-shot references. Match their level of specificity. Do not copy their numbers.

--- Inventory platform ---
A regional distributor needed a web tool to track stock across three warehouses,
with role-based access and a nightly CSV import from their ERP.
Estimate: discovery 2 weeks, API and import 6 weeks, UI 4 weeks.
Team: 2 backend developers, 1 frontend developer. About 14 weeks.

--- Clinic booking app ---
A clinic wanted a mobile app for patients to book visits, receive reminders,
and let staff mark appointments as completed.
Estimate: auth and profiles 3 weeks, calendar and notifications 5 weeks, staff console 3 weeks.
Team: 1 mobile developer, 1 backend developer. About 12 weeks.

--- Internal leave tracker ---
An operations team asked for an internal tool where employees request leave
and managers approve it, with a monthly export.
Estimate: forms and approvals 3 weeks, export and audit log 2 weeks.
Team: 1 full-stack developer. About 6 weeks.
